<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Propane cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Propane cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds has cut its rating for Suburban Propane Partners LP to accumulate from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened up 1/8 to 20-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
